  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you enter your Genie's Vessel with Bottled Respite, you can choose up to five willing creatures you can see within 30 feet of you; they are drawn into the vessel with you. As a Bonus Action, you can eject any number of them, and everyone is ejected if you leave or die, or if the vessel is destroyed.</p><p>In addition, anyone who remains within the vessel for at least 10 minutes gains the benefit of finishing a Short Rest, and anyone who spends Hit Point Dice to regain Hit Points as part of that Short Rest adds your Proficiency Bonus to the Hit Points regained.</p>",
